vars: {
  d2-config: {
    sketch: true
  }
}

direction: down

User: {shape: person}

Client: Client Layer {
  ui: Discord-like Chat UI
}

Mesh: Agent Mesh Layer {
  a1: Agent A
  a2: Agent B
  a3: Agent C

  a1 <-> a2: sessions (1..n)
  a2 <-> a3: sessions (1..n)
  a1 <-> a3: sessions (1..n)
}

Memory: Project Memory Layer {
  am: Agent Memory\none store per agent\nrole / rules / episodes
  kg: Knowledge Graph\none graph per project\nDOCUMENT · PAPER · CLAIM · CONCEPT
}

Config: Custom Config

User <-> Client.ui: chat
Client.ui <-> Mesh: messages\n(every agent)
Mesh <-> Memory.am: each agent reads and writes\nonly its own store
Mesh <-> Memory.kg: agents in this project read\nthe one graph; documents enter through ingest
Config -> Mesh: define swarm
